CVSS 8.5 — &lt;p&gt;CISA has added four new vulnerabilities to its &lt;a href="https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog"&gt;Known Exploited Vulnerabilities (KEV) Catalog&lt;/a&gt;, based on evidence of active exploitation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2024-7399" target="_blank"&gt;CVE-2024-7399&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;Samsung&amp;nbsp;MagicINF. Full analysis, Sigma/YARA rules, IOCs by CYBERDUDEBIVASH SENTINEL APEX.
